 Up to 48,000 Cleaves</li>\n                  <li>Operation: One-Step Automatic</li>\n                  <li>Weight: Approx. 185g</li>\n                  <li>Warranty: 01 Year Service </li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h3>The Corelink W-08 One Step Automatic Fiber Cleaver is a professional-grade fiber optic cutting tool designed for precise and consistent cleaving in FTTH, FTTx, and telecom network installations. Engineered for efficiency, this cleaver features a one-step automatic operation that significantly reduces working time while ensuring high-quality fiber cuts for optimal fusion splicing results.</h3><p><br></p><p>With a cleave angle of ≤0.5°, the Corelink W-08 guarantees low splice loss and high-performance connectivity. Its durable blade supports up to 48,000 cleaves, making it a cost-effective solution for technicians, ISPs, and network engineers in Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><p>Compact, lightweight, and easy to operate, this cleaver is ideal for both field and lab use. The tool-free blade rotation and user-friendly design make maintenance simple, ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>One-step automatic cleaving operation</li><li>High precision cleave angle ≤0.5°</li><li>Long blade life up to 48,000 cuts</li><li>Supports 250µm to 900µm fiber coating</li><li>Tool-free blade adjustment system</li><li>Compact and portable design</li><li>Stable and consistent cutting performance</li><li>Easy maintenance and user-friendly operation</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n       